Now game.js.

Also main.js will create Renderer, Game, Input; loop with fixed timestep.

Game fields/methods detail. Let me write it.

Careful with `state==='paused'`: main might pause by setting game.paused. I'll implement `pause()` storing state, `resume()`.

`game.state` values: 'title','intro','fight','roundEnd','matchEnd'. Pause handled by a boolean `game.paused` rather than state to keep simple, with overlay. Main calls game.togglePause(); game only pauses during fight/intro/roundEnd. Loop skips updates when paused.

Let's write.

Announce helper:
```js
announceNow(text, opts={}) {
  this.announce = { text, sub: opts.sub || '', style: opts.style||'gold', size: opts.size||110, life: opts.dur||1.2, dur: opts.dur||1.2, y: opts.y||300, glow: opts.glow };
}
```

Intro sequence: 
- startRound sets state intro, introT=1.7, announce 'ROUND n' life 1.2.
- announce life will expire before fight. When introT ends → FIGHT! announce 0.8s.
Actually to build tension: announce ROUND 1 at start, then at introT 0.5 show FIGHT? Fine.

During intro, fighters idle; player can't move. Good.

`roundEndT` 2.8. `winPoseT` 0.9.

`startRound` positions: p at 420, c at 860. Camera fixed. p facing 1, c facing -1.

Health reset each round. Meter carry (SF style) — keep. Let's preserve meter across rounds, reset at match start.

Match end overlay: main detects state change to 'matchEnd' and calls showResults. Provide game.matchWinner/isPlayerWin, scores.

Results: show "YOU WIN"/"YOU LOSE"/"DRAW"? Best of 3 ensures someone reaches 2, no draw match. Round draw possible.

Add perfect: if winner.hp === maxHp at end of round, announce sub 'PERFECT!'.

After matchEnd, allow input "Enter" to rematch (main handles). 

Now damage/effects.

`applyStrike`:

```js
applyStrike(att, def, data, hx, hy) {
  if (def.state === 'ko' || def.state === 'knockdown') return;
  const facing = data.facing ?? att.facing;
  const blocked = def.isBlocking() && !(data.low && !def.crouching) && !(data.overhead && def.crouching);
  // invuln
  if (def.invuln > 0) return;

  const meterGain = data.meterGain ?? 6;
  if (blocked) {
    const chip = data.chip || 0;
    def.hp = Math.max(0, def.hp - chip);
    def.blockstun = Math.max(def.blockstun, data.blockstun || 0.16);
    def.vx = facing * (data.kb || 140) * 0.45;
    if (att) att.vx = -facing * 40;
    att.meter = clamp(att.meter + meterGain*0.5, 0, 100);
    def.meter = clamp(def.meter + meterGain*0.7, 0, 100);
    this.fx.blockSpark(hx, hy);
    this.sfx.block();
    this.hitstop = Math.max(this.hitstop, 0.045);
    this.shake = Math.max(this.shake, 2.5);
    if (def.hp <= 0) this.ko(def, att);
    return;
  }
  const dmg = Math.max(1, Math.round(data.damage || 0));
  def.hp = Math.max(0, def.hp - dmg);
  def.flash = 0.14;
  def.move = null;
  def.blockstun = 0;
  def.crouching = false;
  def.state = 'hitstun';
  def.hitstun = data.hitstun || 0.28;
  def.vx = facing * (data.kb || 140);
  if (data.launch) {
    def.airborne = true; def.vy = 650; def.y = Math.max(def.y, 2); def.hitstun = 1.3;
  }
  if (data.knockdown && !data.launch && (!data.maxHits || data.hits >= data.maxHits)) {
    def.state='knockdown'; def.knockdown=0.95; def.hitstun=0;
    def.vx = facing * (data.kb||140) * 0.9;
  }
  // stats, meter, combo
  if (att) { att.meter = clamp(att.meter + meterGain, 0, 100); att.combo++; att.comboTimer=1.1; att.stats.damageDealt += dmg; att.stats.maxCombo = Math.max(att.stats.maxCombo, att.combo); }
  def.meter = clamp(def.meter + meterGain*0.75, 0, 100);
  const power = clamp(dmg/120, 0.3, 2);
  this.fx.hitSpark(hx, hy, power, att?.pal.energy2 || '#ffd9a0', att?.pal.energy || '#ff5d4d');
  this.shake = Math.max(this.shake, data.shake || 5);
  this.hitstop = Math.max(this.hitstop, data.hitstop || 0.06);
  this.sfx.hit(power);
  if (data.launch) this.fx.shock(hx, hy, 1.2, att?.pal.energy2);
  if (def.hp <= 0) this.ko(def, att);
}
```
Combo issue: combo should reset if the defender was actionable. We increment attacker.combo on each hit; timer 1.1 resets. If you throw a jab after 2 seconds, timer expired, so combo starts at 1. Good.

Attack stats.

